    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Web_Enhancements\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Web Enhancements\">Star Wars Saga Edition Web Enhancements</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews\" title=\"Star Wars Miniatures Previews\">Star Wars Miniatures Previews</a>)</i> </p><p>An Ooglith Masquer grants a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a> a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> checks when disguising themselves as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>. Putting on or removing an Ooglith Masquer requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a> and moves the wearer -3 steps on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. (These steps may be recovered normally). </p>",
